          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 260.07,
          "end": 261.76,
          "en": "and with these mixins,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 261.76,
          "end": 265.73,
          "en": "you can share all the component options you typically have",
